{"text":"kuruntokai","n":22,"lines":["நீர்வார் கண்ணை நீயிவண் ஒழிய","யாரோ பிரிகிற் பவரே சாரற்","சிலம்பணி கொண்ட வலஞ்சுரி மராஅத்து","வேனில் அஞ்சினை கமழும்","தேமூர் ஒண்ணுதல் நின்னொடுஞ் செலவே"],"tr":["nīrvār kaṇṇai nīyivaṇ oḻiya","yārō pirikiṟ pavarē cāraṟ","cilampaṇi koṇṭa valañcuri marāattu","vēṉil añciṉai kamaḻum","tēmūr oṇṇutal niṉṉoṭuñ celavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"சேரமானெந்தை","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Cēramāṉentai"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, veṇṭaḷai 7"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"நீர்வார்","tr":"nīrvār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீர்","tr":"nīr"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வார்","tr":"vār"}]},{"text":"கண்ணை","tr":"kaṇṇai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணை","tr":"ṇai"}]},{"text":"நீயிவண்","tr":"nīyivaṇ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீ","tr":"nī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிவண்","tr":"yivaṇ"}]},{"text":"ஒழிய","tr":"oḻiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒழி","tr":"oḻi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]}],[{"text":"யாரோ","tr":"yārō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரோ","tr":"rō"}]},{"text":"பிரிகிற்","tr":"pirikiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிரி","tr":"piri"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கிற்","tr":"kiṟ"}]},{"text":"பவரே","tr":"pavarē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பவ","tr":"pava"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]},{"text":"சாரற்","tr":"cāraṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரற்","tr":"raṟ"}]}],[{"text":"சிலம்பணி","tr":"cilampaṇi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிலம்","tr":"cilam"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பணி","tr":"paṇi"}]},{"text":"கொண்ட","tr":"koṇṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொண்","tr":"koṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"வலஞ்சுரி","tr":"valañcuri","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வலஞ்","tr":"valañ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுரி","tr":"curi"}]},{"text":"மராஅத்து","tr":"marāattu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரா","tr":"marā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அத்","tr":"at"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"வேனில்","tr":"vēṉil","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னில்","tr":"ṉil"}]},{"text":"அஞ்சினை","tr":"añciṉai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அஞ்","tr":"añ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சினை","tr":"ciṉai"}]},{"text":"கமழும்","tr":"kamaḻum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கம","tr":"kama"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழும்","tr":"ḻum"}]}],[{"text":"தேமூர்","tr":"tēmūr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மூர்","tr":"mūr"}]},{"text":"ஒண்ணுதல்","tr":"oṇṇutal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒண்","tr":"oṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணுதல்","tr":"ṇutal"}]},{"text":"நின்னொடுஞ்","tr":"niṉṉoṭuñ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நின்","tr":"niṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னொடுஞ்","tr":"ṉoṭuñ"}]},{"text":"செலவே","tr":"celavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செல","tr":"cela"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"water (tears)"},{"surface":"வார்","parts":[{"text":"வார்","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"flow"}],"gloss":"flowing"},{"surface":"கண்ணை","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"pronominal suffix (second person singular)"}],"gloss":"you who have eyes"},{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"இவண்","parts":[{"text":"இவண்","lemma":"இவண்","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"ஒழிய","parts":[{"text":"ஒழி","lemma":"ஒழி","gloss":"stay behind"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to stay behind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாரோ","parts":[{"text":"யார்","lemma":"யார்","gloss":"who"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"clitic of emphasis/interrogative"}],"gloss":"who indeed?"},{"surface":"பிரிகிற்பவரே","parts":[{"text":"பிரி","lemma":"பிரி","gloss":"separate"},{"text":"கில்","lemma":"கில்","gloss":"ability marker"},{"text":"பவர்","lemma":"பவர்","gloss":"they (who do)"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"clitic of emphasis"}],"gloss":"those who are capable of separating"},{"surface":"சாரல்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"சாரல்","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சிலம்பு","parts":[{"text":"சிலம்பு","lemma":"சிலம்பு","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"அணி","parts":[{"text":"அணி","lemma":"அணி","gloss":"ornament"}],"gloss":"ornament"},{"surface":"கொண்ட","parts":[{"text":"கொண்ட","lemma":"கொண்ட","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வலஞ்சுரி","parts":[{"text":"வலம்","lemma":"வலம்","gloss":"right side"},{"text":"சுரி","lemma":"சுரி","gloss":"spiral"}],"gloss":"right-spiraling"},{"surface":"மராஅத்து","parts":[{"text":"மராஅத்து","lemma":"மராஅத்து","gloss":"of the marāam tree"}],"gloss":"of the marāam tree","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வேனில்","parts":[{"text":"வேனில்","lemma":"வேனில்","gloss":"summer season"}],"gloss":"summer"},{"surface":"அஞ்சினை","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"beautiful"},{"text":"சினை","lemma":"சினை","gloss":"branch"}],"gloss":"beautiful branch"},{"surface":"கமழும்","parts":[{"text":"கமழ்","lemma":"கமழ்","gloss":"emit fragrance"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"fragrant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தேமூர்","parts":[{"text":"தேம்","lemma":"தேம்","gloss":"sweetness"},{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"ooze/spread"}],"gloss":"sweetness-oozing"},{"surface":"ஒண்ணுதல்","parts":[{"text":"ஒள்","lemma":"ஒள்","gloss":"bright"},{"text":"நுதல்","lemma":"நுதல்","gloss":"forehead"}],"gloss":"bright forehead"},{"surface":"நின்னொடும்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you (oblique)"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with (sociative case)"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even/also"}],"gloss":"even with you"},{"surface":"செலவே","parts":[{"text":"செலவு","lemma":"செலவு","gloss":"journey"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"clitic of emphasis"}],"gloss":"the journey indeed"}]}],"literal":"Water flowing eyes-having-you, you here to stay behind, / who indeed are those capable of separating? Mountain slope's / ornament having, right-spiraling marāam tree's / summer beautiful branch fragrant, / sweetness-oozing bright forehead, even with you, the journey!","translation":"With tears streaming from your eyes, if you were to stay behind here, who indeed could leave you? O one with a sweet-scented, bright forehead! His journey through the mountain slopes—adorned with the right-spiraling blossoms of the marāam tree that fragrance the summer from their beautiful branches—will surely be with you.","modern":"கண்களில் நீர் வழிய நீ இங்கே தங்கிவிட, உன்னைப் பிரிந்து செல்பவர் யார்தான் இருக்கிறார்கள்? மலையின் பக்கத்தில், மலைக்கு அணிகலனாக விளங்கும், வலப்பக்கமாகச் சுழிந்த பூக்களைக் கொண்ட மராஅ மரத்தின் அழகிய கிளைகள் கோடைகாலத்தில் நறுமணம் வீசும். தேன் போன்ற நறுமணம் கமழும் ஒளிரும் நெற்றியை உடையவளே! அவனுடைய பயணம் உன்னோடும் சேர்ந்ததுதான்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the tōḻi (confidante) to comfort the talaivi (heroine) when the talaivaṉ (hero) plans a journey through the arid desert (pālai) to acquire wealth. The heroine is distressed at the prospect of separation, her eyes filled with tears. The confidante reassures her that no one could possibly have the heart to leave her behind in such grief. She points out that the mountain slopes are adorned with the beautiful, right-spiraling blossoms of the marāam tree, which spread a sweet fragrance even in the harsh summer. By comparing the heroine's sweet-scented, bright forehead to this beautiful landscape, the confidante implies that the hero's journey will not be a separation, but rather that he will take her along with him.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.27],[1.61,2.38],[2.38,2.9],[2.9,3.22],[3.4,3.6],[3.7,4.1],[4.1,4.97],[4.97,5.5],[5.5,6.4],[6.4,6.9],[6.9,8.3],[8.3,8.8],[8.8,9.2],[9.2,9.69],[9.69,10.5],[10.5,11.2],[11.2,11.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,3.6],[3.6,3.9],[4.0,4.3],[4.3,5.01],[5.01,5.75],[5.75,6.2],[6.2,7.25],[7.25,7.95],[7.95,8.3],[8.3,8.65],[8.65,10.4],[10.4,11.0],[11.0,12.0],[12.0,12.9],[12.9,13.2]]},"sync":[[["நீர்","water (tears)"],["வார்","flowing"]],[["கண்ணை","you who have eyes"]],[["நீ","you"],["இவண்","here"]],[["ஒழிய","to stay behind"]],[["யாரோ","who indeed?"]],[["பிரிகிற்பவரே","those who are capable of separating"]],[["பிரிகிற்பவரே","those who are capable of separating"]],[["சாரல்","mountain slope"]],[["சிலம்பு","mountain"],["அணி","ornament"]],[["கொண்ட","having"]],[["வலஞ்சுரி","right-spiraling"]],[["மராஅத்து","of the marāam tree"]],[["வேனில்","summer"]],[["அஞ்சினை","beautiful branch"]],[["கமழும்","fragrant"]],[["தேமூர்","sweetness-oozing"]],[["ஒண்ணுதல்","bright forehead"]],[["நின்னொடும்","even with you"]],[["செலவே","the journey indeed"]]]}